- The public StockQA runner is not yet wired to this store because production binding requires the authoritative StockWiki W03 identity projection. No StockWiki files were modified.
- Budget reservation/settlement, StockWiki outbox ACK/import, and asynchronous transport are separate unresolved Q09/W05/Q06 integration gates.

